<title>UK: German inland gas oil retreats, demand steady.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil retreats, demand steady.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.5535)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     38.30/38.60     24.65/24.84     38.80/39.20</p>
<p> BREMEN		38.30/38.60     24.65/24.84     38.80/39.20</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    38.00/38.30     24.46/24.65     38.70/39.10</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   38.40/38.90     24.71/25.04     39.50/39.80</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   38.40/38.80     24.71/24.97     39.60/39.90</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  39.40/39.70     25.36/25.55     40.60/40.90</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices declined further on Tuesday in line with weaker futures. End-user demand improved, traders said. The dollar was steady against the mark. -- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
